  "Windows repeat on a fixed cycle and keep their local times when daylight time changes. Inside a window each boss spawns at a random time; a boss marked with a % may skip a window. A boss still up from an earlier window that is killed after the next one opens comes back inside that same window, often right away. Exact spawn times are never shown.": "時段依固定週期重複，日光節約時間切換時仍維持原本的當地時間。時段內每隻 Boss 在隨機時間出沒；標有 % 的 Boss 可能會跳過某個時段。上一個時段留下、在下一個時段開放後才被擊殺的 Boss，會在同一個時段內重新出現，通常很快就出來。精確出沒時間一律不顯示。",
